](file:///workspace/product/history/evidence/record-d46f9580f1.md) only applied to US CSV <100k rows and explicitly excluded NDJSON and `record-6a8741fe3b`.\n- **Next Useful Actions:**\n  1. Prepare a reversible change to decouple signed URL generation and TTL from initial job creation (minting upon worker completion or calculating TTL dynamically).\n  2. Investigate the relation scan cursor checkpoint resumption logic in NDJSON exports and build multi-million row test fixtures.\n  3. Update [`current.md`](file:///workspace/product/current.md) to record the current evidence and provide accurate status guidance to support.\n\nPlease see [`/workspace/work/decision.md`](file:///workspace/work/decision.md) for the full analysis, timeline, citations, and uncertainties."}
